# Day 36 – Explore Your Thinking Patterns 🧠

## Challenge
Today I built an interactive **Cognitive Pattern Explorer** using Claude AI.

The application helps users understand how they naturally think, make decisions, and respond to uncertainty through engaging scenarios, reflection activities, and interactive exercises.

